  "summary": "Malicious code in @sqlite-prime/createsql (npm)",
  "details": "When imported, this package fetches JavaScript code from a GitHub Gist (getchainverse/198a0bbec7a6018e9250615d26e37b90) via the GitHub API and executes it with eval(). The Gist content is attacker-controlled, making this a remote-code-execution dropper. The package has no lifecycle hooks — the payload runs on require().",
